  "visible_text": "LAST CARBON ISLES / POLICY ATLAS\nThe Last Carbon Isles\n\nA small chain of islands. One shared budget. No clean air left to waste.\n\nSHARED BUDGET\n4B\nPOLICY TURNS\n5 / 6\nINPUT\nDIRECT DRAG\nTHE ARCHIPELAGO\nKeep the islands lit. Keep the crews aboard.\nJOINT GOAL\n0 SMOKE + 100 CREWS\nThorn Cay\n\u2726\n0\nSMOKE\n101\nCREWS\nCinder Key\n\u2726\n0\nSMOKE\n101\nCREWS\nLumen Shoal\n\u2726\n0\nSMOKE\n101\nCREWS\nMorrow Atoll\n\u2726\n0\nSMOKE\n101\nCREWS\nVesper Isle\n\u2726\n0\nSMOKE\n101\nCREWS\nN\n\u2304\nEACH ISLE REPORTS ITS OWN BURDEN\nSMOKE TO CLEAR\nCREWS TO PROTECT\nEvery placement redraws the ledger.\nTHE HAND\n1 POLICY REMAIN\n\nDrag a policy from the hand onto its home isle.\n\nSHORTCUT\n\u22123B\nEmergency Rationing\nA tempting fast fix. It cuts smoke, but it does not protect the island's crews.\nHOME \u00b7 Vesper Isle\n\u22127 smoke \u00b7 \u22124 crews\nDRAG \u2197\nDECK RESEARCH\n0 ROUTES UNCHARTED\nDECK COMPLETE\nAll research routes have been charted.\nCERTIFY ISLES\n\u2192\nPOLICIES ARE PUBLIC.\nTHE ORDER IS YOURS.\nLEDGER\n0 SMOKE REMAINING\n101 LOWEST CREW LEVEL\nPASS\nCARBON ISLES LEDGER / FINAL READ\nCLEAR\n\nEvery isle is clear.\n\nLEDGER ACCEPTED"
